{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/874c64f097a74b6b45f7f24349d60e67.poster.avif?t=1758132119\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/874c64f097a74b6b45f7f24349d60e67.webm?t=1758132119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the chaotic world of <i>Why Me</i> with this free demo!</strong><br>This 2D platformer challenges you with fast-paced levels full of traps, surprises, and precision jumps. The demo gives you a taste of the madness, enough to test your skills and leave you wanting more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/3b9e743e0eab871251268ee513140442.poster.avif?t=1758132119\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/3b9e743e0eab871251268ee513140442.webm?t=1758132119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/3b9e743e0eab871251268ee513140442.mp4?t=1758132119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s included in this demo:</strong><br>\u2022 6 Chapters with 30 Levels: Experience the early part of the game with dozens of challenging stages.<br>\u2022 Skill-Based Gameplay: Master tricky jumps, hidden traps, and clever obstacles that demand timing and precision.<br>\u2022 Story Introduction: Uncover the beginning of Lord Reginald\u2019s sinister game as he watches over your struggle to escape his castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.poster.avif?t=1758132119\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.webm?t=1758132119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/47ba7c239b49a47e1d1d199084b597d4.mp4?t=1758132119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s waiting in the full game:</strong> <br>\u2022 16 Chapters with 80 Levels: The complete chaotic journey across all stages. <br>\u2022 Expanded Storyline: Discover the full tale of Lord Reginald and his twisted castle. <br>\u2022 Speedrun Mode &amp; Leaderboards: Race against the clock and compete with players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/e846e07f6516ce6c9a73ea12f4d98d64.poster.avif?t=1758132119\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996990/extras/e846e07f6516ce6c9a73ea12f4d98d64.webm?t=1758132119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive Lord Reginald\u2019s twisted entertainment, or will the castle claim you like the rest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akam